<title>FINLAND: EFORE REPEATS SEES NET SALES RISE.</title>
<headline>EFORE REPEATS SEES NET SALES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish electronics component maker Efore Oy repeated in a statement on Friday its net sales in the year ended Oct 31 would rise to 185 million markka from 152 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>OTC-listed Efore said its results will be published on December 19.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
</text>
